ge">0</span></h2></article><article class="painel"><div class="vazio"></div></article><article class="painel"><div class="vazio"></div></article></section><div class="botoes"><a class="botao" href="usuarios.php">Gerenciar usuários</a><a class="botao" href="treinamentos.php">Gerenciar treinamentos</a><a class="botao" href="logout.php">Sair</a></div></main></body></html>
